<section id="agreement" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 md:px-12 md:py-20">
	<h2 class="font-anton text-4xl md:text-5xl">Where do calculators agree?</h2>
	<p class="mt-3 max-w-[65ch] text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
		The shaded band is the middle 50% of systems around the consensus median at each weight, faceted by skill.
		Disagreement here is useful uncertainty to know about, not a flaw in the comparison.
	</p>

	<div id="vg-agreement-chart" class="mt-8">
		<div class="flex justify-end">
			<button type="button" data-vg-table-toggle class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-blue" aria-pressed="false">
				View as table
			</button>
		</div>
		<div data-vg-chart class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto"></div>
		<div data-vg-table class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto"></div>
	</div>

	<script src="../../../scripts/surf-volume/agreement-chart.ts"></script>
</section>
